["SUDDENRAID-ASTREA"],"ded_stat":"DMGAmp","gear":{"sets":[{"name":"Avenger","effect":"4pc - Damage Dealt +30%.\nBoss Damage +40%."}],"weapon":["Crit","CritDMG"],"armor":["AllATK%","DmgTakenReduce"]},"substats":["Crit","CritDMG","WeaknessHit","AllATK%","AllATK","Speed"],"gear_notes":"To take down Astrea fast, this build focuses on maximising as much damage as possible.","acc":[{"label":"Best","main":"Guts","main_info":{"icon":"L-Guts.webp","key":"Guts","tier":"L","label":"Guts","value":"150% ATK Barrier, 4 turns"},"sub":"CritRate","sub_info":{"icon":"C-CritRate.webp","key":"CritRate","tier":"C","label":"Crit Rate","value":"+10%"}}]},{"name":"Early-Game","active":false,"note":"","modes":["RAID-OX","ADVENTURE BOTH"],"ded_stat":"DMGAmp","gear":{"sets":[{"name":"Assassin","effect":"4pc - Crit Rate +30%.\nIgnore Defense +15%."}],"weapon":["Crit","CritDMG"],"armor":["AllATK%","DmgTakenReduce"]},"substats":["Crit","CritDMG","WeaknessHit","AllATK%","AllATK","Speed"],"gear_notes":"It is very important to land Crits on the Ox King minions to kill them properly so focus primarily on Crit Rate & Crit DMG. This is a more early-game build.","acc":[{"label":"Best","main":"BossDMG","main_info":{"icon":"R-BossDMG.webp","key":"BossDMG","tier":"R","label":"Boss DMG","value":"+12%"},"sub":"CritRate","sub_info":{"icon":"C-CritRate.webp","key":"CritRate","tier":"C","label":"Crit Rate","value":"+10%"}},{"label":"Alt 1","main":"BossDMG","main_info":{"icon":"R-BossDMG.webp","key":"BossDMG","tier":"R","label":"Boss DMG","value":"+12%"},"sub":"WeaknessHit","sub_info":{"icon":"C-WeaknessHit.webp","key":"WeaknessHit","tier":"C","label":"Weakness Hit","value":"+12%"}},{"label":"Alt 2","main":"BossDMG","main_info":{"icon":"R-BossDMG.webp","key":"BossDMG","tier":"R","label":"Boss DMG","value":"+12%"},"sub":"13AOE","sub_info":{"icon":"R-13AOE.webp","key":"13AOE","tier":"R","label":"1-3 Target DMG","value":"+10%"}}]}],"dedicated":{"name":"Daisy's Palm-Leaf Fan","main_stat":"MATK +247","icon":"Daisy.webp","a":[{"name":"DMGAmp","value":"+4%","icon":"DMGAmp.webp"},{"name":"DMGAmp","value":"+4%","icon":"DMGAmp.webp"},{"name":"DMGAmp","value":"+4%","icon":"DMGAmp.webp"},{"name":"DMGAmp","value":"+4%","icon":"DMGAmp.webp"}],"b":[{"name":"AllATK%","value":"+12%","icon":"AllATK%25.webp"},{"name":"AllATK%","value":"+12%","icon":"AllATK%25.webp"},{"name":"AllATK%","value":"+12%","icon":"AllATK%25.webp"},{"name":"AllATK%","value":"+12%","icon":"AllATK%25.webp"}],"second":"no","why_by_stat":{"DMGAmp":"Increases all damage dealt by Daisy by the given %, making it useful for both general damage and higher PVE scores. Also increases DOT damage."},"story":"Don't you know who rules the night?\"\n\nUnidentified assassins break the stillness of the midnight air as they moved down the corridor outside the lord's office. Sensing their presence, Daisy concealed herself with cat-like agility then brandished her palm-leaf fan from the shadows. In an instant, the assassins were sent flying before they could even scream, and Daisy stood guard over Ace's office in the ensuing silence.\n\n\"Ace, I'll wipe away every filthy stain that threatens to break the calm of the night.\""},"used_in":[{"tip":"Raid: Ox King","cat":"pve","banner":"RAID_OX.webp"},{"tip":"Sudden Raid: Astrea","cat":"pve","banner":"RAID_SUDDEN_ASTREA.webp"},{"tip":"Advent Expedition: God of Destruction","cat":"pve","banner":"ADVENT_GOD.webp"},{"tip":"Advent Expedition: Teo & Yeonhee","cat":"pve","banner":"ADVENT_TEOYH.webp"},{"tip":"Tower of Trials","cat":"pve","banner":"TOWER_OF_TRIALS.webp"},{"tip":"Adventure (Both)","cat":"pve","banner":"ADVENTURE_BOTH.webp"}],"lore":"Daisy's little brother Ace became lord at an early age.\nDuring a tumultuous war on Moonlit Isle, Ace was abducted by enemy forces.\nTo rescue her brother, Daisy made a pact with a cat yokai, gaining the powers of yin-yang arts, and as a result of this pact her body has taken on feline features.\nEventually, the war ended in victory for Ace, and he turned his focus to governing the domain.\nDaisy stood by his side every step of the way.\nDaisy wished for her brother to handle the honorable, bright tasks befitting a lord during the day.\nBut the realities of leadership meant there were always dishonorable, shadowy tasks that needed to be taken care of at night.\nTo shoulder these burdens, Daisy founded the Moonlight Guards to protect Ace while managing such clandestine affairs.\nThat is why the locals call her the Night Ruler of Moonlit Isle."}